{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_title", "source_sha256": "34e29ad83aadb8dc9420e7bc7eb5a624e134f2fb8dffad8ed189d5e75d254721", "ja": "虹の彼方、先へ", "zh": "彩虹的彼端，向着前方", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4cd6b169b02ed5ecfa63c3d99d9cff691301f6e1f5094e8917550e5d35a6f565", "ja": "憧れのミュージカルにアンサンブル出演が\n決まった可奈。ソロパートのため奮闘するが\n練習では叱られてばかり。落ち込む可奈に声\nを掛けたのはいつかの男の子だった。仲間の\n応援と新曲を手に、可奈はテストに挑む。", "zh": "可奈决定出演梦寐以求的音乐剧的合唱阵容。\n虽然为了独唱段落奋发努力，但排练中却总是\n挨骂。向沮丧的可奈搭话的，是之前遇到的男\n孩子。伴随同伴的加油与新歌，可奈挑战测试。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f6623352ce92e9934faefece7b418325baa375db96985986d62e5da8089904e0", "ja": "（テストが無事終わり、いよいよ結果発表。\n可奈は精いっぱい歌い切ったが、果たして……）", "zh": "（测试顺利结束，终于要公布结果了。可奈已经竭尽全力唱完了，但结果究竟会……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1001_sensei", "source_sha256": "d26f0ac47642bfd69093b6744c50db441df40aba275f1218346f50faa500235f", "ja": "では、ソロパートを発表するわね。\nソロパート1。担当は、矢吹可奈さんです。", "zh": "那么，现在公布独唱部分吧。\n独唱部分1。负责的是矢吹可奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "6fe818ea365fabf2531122f102d27ab6d14dba7880f34a6e8608e9766abccae9", "ja": "……えええっ！？　わ、私、合格ですか！？", "zh": "……诶诶诶！？我、我合格了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1003_sensei", "source_sha256": "8f34af14a29e6150971c7f4a935bf516bc7c3cfcbe6e2f4ee0176b561b3062af", "ja": "本当によく頑張ったわね。今日までの\nレッスンで、一番伸びたのは間違いなくあなたよ。", "zh": "你真的很努力呢。到今天为止的\n训练中，你毫无疑问是进步最大的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1004_sensei", "source_sha256": "896482c89398fa06f08c30e53ce2e2da91ff16d66976bca3bed7ef6f129fcb2c", "ja": "期待していた分、指導も厳しくなったけど、\nよくついてきました。おめでとう、矢吹さん。", "zh": "正因为对你抱有期待，指导也变得更加严格了，但你还是很好地坚持了下来。恭喜你，矢吹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "be00f110d744df8f1b9fc7f690adc49d1de025bf3655746a0931e66da3cad9ec", "ja": "あっ……。わ、私、絶対合格したくて……。\nそれで、一生懸命練習して……。", "zh": "啊……我、我特别想通过考核……所以就拼命练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "a55a5e99162ccdc413cd9af077d0743749927a087699c58fbdaacebbe12a2bb8", "ja": "……ぐすっ。ううっ、うわ～～～ん！\nよかった……本当に、よかったよぉ……。", "zh": "……呜呜。呜哇——！\n太好了……真的太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8a7a4dfbd487922338962f91b93edd3ebb728b611ec2577f6d52027e85233cc2", "ja": "おめでとう、可奈！　よかったな。\n絶対、合格するって信じてたよ。", "zh": "恭喜你，可奈！太好了。\n我一直相信你绝对能合格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "194d6ec610f0cee495f1f0fad0122ce7a0b1a1116a3551bee52865d8f83a1364", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん……！\nぐすっ……。ありがとうございます……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生～……！\n呜……。谢谢您……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "350674b06f85bf7404eeadf11bb0174e01cb29eab6438a437a1535369c76f351", "ja": "私、本当に期待してもらえてたんだって思ったら、\nそれもうれしくて……ううっ。", "zh": "想到自己真的被大家寄予厚望，\n心里好高兴……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "c0bb8aac9616b54d7416c647c09170b6bb1ed423fa39610b54b149792d080afd", "ja": "可奈ちゃん、合格おめでとう！\n新曲、本当に素敵だったよ♪", "zh": "可奈，恭喜你合格！\n新歌真的很棒哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "c7818b3b4d363a85b46113d393f708d8c0adf95b9d16ed40a84abfd12a142095", "ja": "は、春香さん！　それにみんなも……！\nぐすっ、ありがとうございます～！", "zh": "春香前辈！还有大家也……！\n呜呜，谢谢你们～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "1773d17c36c64b5bfc6de5a9eef60f0da9e3865da4ce2ce4ffb61a82c4a9015a", "ja": "も～、そんなに泣かないの、可奈！\nおめでたいことなんだから笑わないと……ぐすっ。", "zh": "真是的，别哭得这么厉害啦，可奈！这是值得庆祝的事，得笑一笑才行……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "b83051862804a2a3709336ba5403470ee4c7d4cccac24ab33eb3f3d969462d91", "ja": "ふふっ、恵美ちゃんも泣いちゃってるね。\nでもでも、私もとってもうれしいな！", "zh": "呵呵，惠美也哭起来了呢。\n不过不过，我也真的特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "8065686008a16ea891f2e39bc8ed76c22002a9c131d490f2ac1f6b8e395b40b3", "ja": "もしかしたら、自分のことよりうれしいかも……？\nなんだか不思議ですね♪", "zh": "说不定，比自己的事还要开心呢……？\n总觉得好不可思议呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "addc799ca1cffed90c3e88638fed7f381e20ff4918248b9142bc95b939335de5", "ja": "矢吹さんが、諦めずに努力した結果だもの。\n一緒にステージに立てるのを、楽しみにしているわ。", "zh": "这是矢吹同学不放弃、努力坚持的结果。\n我很期待能和你一起站上舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "453b68a9df7fb29aa36a187ba006730e4824504ba97a227f1d2069c1e0cbbe31", "ja": "うぅ……ありがとうございますっ！\n私、一生懸命がんばりますっ！", "zh": "呜呜……非常感谢您！\n我一定会拼尽全力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1017_p", "source_sha256": "34228c03383fac817feca5950934ae18a11b0acbd1700e535960e252f9df7a49", "ja": "そうだな。本番はこれからだ。レッスンは\n続くけど……可奈なら、きっと大丈夫だ。", "zh": "是啊。正式演出现在才要开始。虽然训练还会继续……但如果是可奈，一定没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "f82470934b816dc21421ce087b1278942b0e1cca687450f24c3fcfb563cef59b", "ja": "はいっ！　私、もうへこたれたりしません！\n本番まで、よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "是！我已经不会再消沉了！\n到正式演出为止，还请多多关照♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1019_p", "source_sha256": "bf3553ed6cd3a6d51df7c0a4f9feb1ffe4631c8f3a047b2ecfacf5fb564e6a0c", "ja": "ああ！　……と、それはいいんだけど。\n可奈、顔が涙と鼻水で酷いことになって……。", "zh": "啊！……这倒是挺好的，不过。\n可奈，你的脸都被眼泪和鼻涕弄得一团糟了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "340ec5fc1e4b6829602230692e9d67c1b67a8b020741eeebc7c47c6d94ea52f3", "ja": "あっ！？\nすみません、うれしくってつい……えへへ。", "zh": "啊！？\n对不起，因为太开心了一不小心就……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "a26d371e99cc8b2de1dca8e28d03ef36c9198dd7b4333b0a1ae0c35da609dd24", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nチーンしてください！　チーン！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，请帮我叮一下！叮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_111_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1e3d50f12049ae2938795bee4d1343b9547426f5a5f0a152c31883f1190d80c0", "ja": "（成長したかと思えば、まだまだ手のかかるところも\nある……それもまた、可奈の魅力のひとつなんだろう）", "zh": "（还以为可奈已经成长了，没想到还是有不少让人操心的地方……这大概也是可奈的魅力之一吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
